f'(x_i)(x - x_i)$。\\\\n    代入 $(a, b)$：$b = f(x_i) + f'(x_i)(a - x_i) = \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2x_i} + \\\\\\\\ln x_i + \\\\\\\\frac{2x_i-e}{2x_i^2}(a - x_i)$\\\\n    $b = \\\\\\\\frac{ex_i + 2x_i^2 \\\\\\\\ln x_i + (2x_i-e)(a-x_i)}{2x_i^2} = \\\\\\\\frac{ex_i + 2x_i^2 \\\\\\\\ln x_i + 2ax_i - 2x_i^2 - ea + ex_i}{2x_i^2}$\\\\n    $b = \\\\\\\\ln x_i + \\\\\\\\frac{2ex_i + 2ax_i - 2x_i^2 - ea}{2x_i^2} = \\\\\\\\ln x_i + \\\\\\\\frac{e+a}{x_i} - 1 - \\\\\\\\frac{ea}{2x_i^2}$。\\\\n    令 $h(x) = \\\\\\\\ln x + \\\\\\\\frac{e+a}{x} - \\\\\\\\frac{ea}{2x^2} - 1$。\\\\n    $h'(x) = \\\\\\\\frac{1}{x} - \\\\\\\\frac{e+a}{x^2} + \\\\\\\\frac{ea}{x^3} = \\\\\\\\frac{x^2 - (e+a)x + ea}{x^3} = \\\\\\\\frac{(x-e)(x-a)}{x^3}$。\\\\n    因为 $a > e$，所以 $h(x)$ 在 $(0, e)$ 递增，在 $(e, a)$ 递减，在 $(a, +\\\\\\\\infty)$ 递增。\\\\n    要使 $h(x) = b$ 有三个根，必须满足 $h(a) < b < h(e)$。\\\\n\\\\n2.  **证明 $b - f(a) > 0$**：\\\\n    $h(a) = \\\\\\\\ln a + \\\\\\\\frac{e+a}{a} - \\\\\\\\frac{ea}{2a^2} - 1 = \\\\\\\\ln a + \\\\\\\\frac{e}{a} + 1 - \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a} - 1 = \\\\\\\\ln a + \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a}$。\\\\n    而 $f(a) = \\\\\\\\ln a + \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a}$。\\\\n    所以 $h(a) = f(a)$。\\\\n    由 $b > h(a)$ 得 $b - f(a) > 0$。\\\\n\\\\n3.  **证明 $b - f(a) < \\\\\\\\frac{1}{2}(\\\\\\\\frac{a}{e} - 1)$**：\\\\n    由 $b < h(e)$，且 $h(e) = \\\\\\\\ln e + \\\\\\\\frac{e+a}{e} - \\\\\\\\frac{ea}{2e^2} - 1 = 1 + 1 + \\\\\\\\frac{a}{e} - \\\\\\\\frac{a}{2e} - 1 = 1 + \\\\\\\\frac{a}{2e}$。\\\\n    $b - f(a) < h(e) - f(a) = 1 + \\\\\\\\frac{a}{2e} - (\\\\\\\\ln a + \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a})$。\\\\n    令 $\\\\\\\\phi(a) = 1 + \\\\\\\\frac{a}{2e} - \\\\\\\\ln a - \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a} - \\\\\\\\frac{1}{2}(\\\\\\\\frac{a}{e} - 1) = \\\\\\\\frac{3}{2} - \\\\\\\\ln a - \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a}$。\\\\n    $\\\\\\\\phi'(a) = -\\\\\\\\frac{1}{a} + \\\\\\\\frac{e}{2a^2} = \\\\\\\\frac{e-2a}{2a^2}$。\\\\n    由于 $a > e > e/2$，$\\\\\\\\phi'(a) < 0$，$\\\\\\\\phi(a)$ 在 $(e, +\\\\\\\\infty)$ 递减。\\\\n    $\\\\\\\\phi(e) = \\\\\\\\frac{3}{2} - 1 - \\\\\\\\frac{1}